  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank delivered technical assistance to the Eastern Caribbean Central Bank (ECCB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity World Bank delivered technical assistance to the Eastern Caribbean Central Bank (ECCB) is a component of Caribbean Financial Resilience Project reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;1,855,499. This project benefits Caribbean, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Public sector policy and administrative management, Financial policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
